    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a strict technical recruiter. Compare the JOB with the CANDIDATE CV parts and give an honest match score from 0 to 100.\n\nJOB\nTitle: {{ $('Loop Jobs').first().json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $('Loop Jobs').first().json.company }}\nTags: {{ ($('Loop Jobs').first().json.tags || []).join(', ') }}\nDescription: {{ ($('Loop Jobs').first().json.description || '').slice(0, 4000) }}\n\nCANDIDATE CV (most relevant parts)\n{{ $json.cv_parts.join('\\n---\\n') }}\n\nScoring rules:\n- 80-100: most required skills present, experience level fits\n- 60-79: good match with some gaps\n- 40-59: weak match, many skills missing\n- 0-39: not relevant\n- If the job needs many more years of experience than the CV shows, lower the score.\n\nverdict: \"strong\" if score >= 70, \"maybe\" if 50-69, \"weak\" if below 50.\nreasoning: 2-3 short sentences.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1472,
        0
      ],
      "id": "553c9f39-f75e-4c7d-9ad8-eeeadad4babb",
      "name": "Score Job",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "options": {}
      },
